				<!-- PLAY/PAUSE/STOP are ROOM-typed: the room routes them to
				     the Digital Audio engine, which pauses/resumes natively.
				     The driver must not re-send them to the room (that loops
				     and restarts Director). Skips are PROTOCOL: track advance
